ECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwjPncvl9dmWAxWTkq8BHbziIXgQ3IcHCOcBKBI",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["味道還可以，以安居街來說確實有可能做出市場區隔，因為拉麵店不多。\n內用區座位乾淨，內場廚房看起來也很乾淨（畢竟是新開的），野莓果茶好喝，推薦~\n價位偏高，但考量裝潢、店面成本以及最終拉麵的成品，我覺得算物有所值吧，想吃的時候會來，但好吃程度還是覺得隔壁真善美最頂...雖然不同品項不能比較啦",null,[0,145]]]],[null,1714960421000000,1714960421000000,"2 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfQ0RkRkZEc0dFaXRtT0RnbEFBeDkydw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfQ0RkRkZEc0dFaXRtT0RnbEFBeDkydxoTQ2d3SXBmRGdzUVlRcVByMmdnTQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjPncvl9dmWAxWTkq8BHbziIXgQ_2MI6AEoEw"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1630689603408244237/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUnFObkpsWkhCblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1630689603408244237/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUnFObkpsWkhCblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1630689603408244237/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUnFObkpsWkhCblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1630689603408244237/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUnFObkpsWkhCblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1630689603408244237/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUnFObkpsWkhCblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1630689603408244237/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUnFObkpsWkhCblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["謝謝您對我們的喜愛,偶爾吃完好吃的真善美,也要想到我們麵匡匡哦,期待您再度光臨!",null,[0,40]]]],[null,null,5983,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURqNnJlZHBnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x466bce506fe7c768!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDj6redpgE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURqNnJlZHBnRRAB\u0